1. Check current branch
git branch


2. Switch to main
git checkout main


3. Get latest code
git pull origin main


4. Create a feature branch
git checkout -b feature/whatsapp


5. Add your code
git add .


6. Commit changes
git commit -m "Update WhatsApp functionality"


7. Push branch to GitHub
git push -u origin feature/whatsapp


8. Create Pull Request

Open GitHub → Pull Requests → New Pull Request.
- Base: main
- Compare: feature/whatsapp
- Click Create pull request.